{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1092383-lfp-cofd-innocents-through-darkness-play-by-post","id":1092383,"title":"[LFP] [CofD] Innocents through Darkness Play-by-Post","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-14T11:08:52-07:00","id":1092383,"title":"[LFP] [CofD] Innocents through Darkness Play-by-Post","content":"<b>I'm still wanting this Chronicle to happen, so I'm reviving this thread. I'm not sure what the forum policy is on making an identical post separately, but whatevs. </b> <br /> <br /> I'm looking to find three or four players to play Chronicles of Darkness in the pbp forum throughout the work week. What I'm interested in is shared storytelling the characters lives as kids, and then their transition into adulthood. If we want our characters to become supernatural, or take the path of a hunter in adulthood, then we can work with that, too.<br /> <br /> Write back if this is up your alley!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12742,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","user":"Doggo","date":".  Edit: Trying to necro...this post, the two interested players stopped responding. 05-31-2017, 12:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-15T15:19:13-07:00","id":1092976,"title":"","content":"Sounds interesting! How long would the playing as children be? And what ages would people be starting at? Also is there a particular time period that players will be children in (80s, 90s)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13461,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13461-aviatorofscience","user":"aviatorofscience","date":". 05-15-2017, 06:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13461-aviatorofscience","name":"aviatorofscience","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-15T15:46:13-07:00","id":1092995,"title":"","content":"I'm interested! I've never played before, but I'm a fast learner. How many posts a day/week will we be expected to do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T07:18:54-07:00","id":1093231,"title":"","content":"So I'm still fairly new to the PbP format, and I'm going to throw a number out there. I would be looking for a minimum of five posts throughout the day. I hope that sounds fair. If there's more, that's also fine <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Aviator, we can discuss that here if you'd like. I have a module prepped to start us out. Ages would be 12 - 14 for our first sessions. <br /> <br /> Time period, 2000s.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T12:28:48-07:00","id":1093374,"title":"","content":"I'm not 100% positive I'd be able to handle 5 posts a day regularly. I suppose it depends on how long the posts end up being. I'm more used to requirements falling between 1 post a day to a few posts a week for the minimum. But I'd be willing to give it a go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T13:44:54-07:00","id":1093406,"title":"","content":"Ha, I was around that age in that time period! Easier to draw inspiration from. <br /> <br /> I'd definitely be interested in playing, and I have a few ideas I've got kicking around for characters if any interested parties wanted to do a group character creation thing - there would be less setup if we're all friends/siblings/otherwise related or know each other in some way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13461,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13461-aviatorofscience","user":"aviatorofscience","date":". 05-16-2017, 04:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13461-aviatorofscience","name":"aviatorofscience","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T06:39:39-07:00","id":1093642,"title":"","content":"Good morning, folks! <br /> <br /> No worries about the post requirement. Like I said, I don't know the standard, but I am fine with having an asynchronous game going <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I like Aviator's idea of having a group character creation. I would like both of your characters to at least by friends or cousins, if not siblings. Also, if you would, please fill out the breaking points sheet for chronicles of darkness, and remember to answer the questions from the perspective of a child, since that's what you'll be <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> For the setting, you'll be attending a suburban school in a town that's not notable for much other than it's new age newspaper and radio. There's a natural woodland bordering the town, and a single highway that leads past it. We're somewhere in northwestern America.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T08:00:53-07:00","id":1093659,"title":"","content":"Sounds good to me! I'm thinking of playing a 12 or 13-year old girl. I'd be cool with them being siblings, Aviator. Maybe even twins?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T14:25:31-07:00","id":1093813,"title":"","content":"Being twin siblings would be fun! What kind of character are you thinking of playing? I'm thinking of playing young teen boy - kind of a &quot;delinquent with a heart of gold&quot; kid","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13461-aviatorofscience","name":"aviatorofscience","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T16:17:05-07:00","id":1093885,"title":"","content":"Awesome. Twins it is then! I'm thinking maybe the daydreamer type with the overactive imagination. The sort who likes to make up wild adventures and stories as she's gallivanting about the woods, but isn't so good with interacting with people outside of her family.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T22:37:42-07:00","id":1093999,"title":"","content":"These are both good descriptions. Feel free to put together your character sheets if you're ready. If you're not sure about Merit choices, ask me and I'll tell you if they're ok.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T03:40:23-07:00","id":1094059,"title":"","content":"Since we're starting out as kids, are there different starting dot allocations? Or should we just use the standard rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T06:09:37-07:00","id":1094098,"title":"","content":"For kids, skill dots don't go above four (?). I would recommend popping into a pdf of the Innocents book, if you can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T09:25:08-07:00","id":1094176,"title":"","content":"I'll see if I can grab one. Is that a Chronicles of Darkness book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T11:41:05-07:00","id":1094244,"title":"","content":"It was produce when CofD was still nWoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T17:33:50-07:00","id":1094356,"title":"","content":"Okay, I checked out Innocents! It looks like the rules for child characters only go up to age 12. After that, it looks like teens are (mostly) treated as adult characters mechanically. I only saw one difference. So, I'm thinking I'll keep things simple and say my girl is 12.<br /> <br /> As a 12-year old, her skills would cap out at 3 dots <br /> <br /> Just one more quick question (for now). Should we be filling out the character sheet in Innocents, or the CofD one and just use the Innocents attribute/skill rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T07:42:53-07:00","id":1094540,"title":"","content":"I would say to use the CofD sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T21:39:59-07:00","id":1094776,"title":"","content":"Cool! I'll try and get a character sheet done this weekend. Might be next week though, since I've got a busy weekend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T16:18:44-07:00","id":1095646,"title":"","content":"Posting to get us back on track. It's been too quiet. Are you both still a Go Go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T16:23:26-07:00","id":1095649,"title":"","content":"Yep, I am! Didn't finish my character sheet this weekend, but it's almost done. Think I just need to pick my merits still.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T05:57:30-07:00","id":1096255,"title":"","content":"Quick question on Merits. I took Quick Draw (<span style=\"font-size:18px\">\u2022</span>) from the Innocents book, but I noticed that Quick Draw works differently between Innocents and Chronicles of Darkness. Can I take the version of the merit from Innocents?<br /> <br /> This is the version from the CofD book:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">Quick Draw (\u2022)</span><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Wits \u2022\u2022\u2022, a Specialty in the weapon or<br /> fighting style chosen<br /> <b>Effect:</b> Choose a Specialty in Weaponry or Firearms when<br /> you purchase this Merit. Your character has trained in that<br /> weapon or style enough that pulling the weapon is his first<br /> reflex. Drawing or holstering that weapon is considered a reflexive<br /> action, and can be done any time his Defense applies.<br /> <br /> And this is the version from the Innocents book:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">Quick Draw (\u2022 or \u2022\u2022)</span><br /> <b>Prerequisite:</b> Dexterity \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> <b>Effect:</b> He always knows exactly where all his stuff<br /> is \u2014 or maybe it\u2019s the result of endless hours spent playing<br /> pirate or mystic space knight. The end result is the same:<br /> your character can draw an item from somewhere on his<br /> person and use it in the same turn (even attack with it, if<br /> the item in question is a weapon).Your character does not<br /> lose his Defense for pulling an item from a pocket or bag<br /> worn, or even a concealed weapon from his person.<br /> This Merit must be bought separately for tools (\u2022<br /> used with all items like flashlights, cameras, cell phones<br /> or keys), melee weapons (\u2022\u2022) or guns (\u2022\u2022).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T07:18:49-07:00","id":1096300,"title":"","content":"The Innocents version is fine by me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-25T06:21:47-07:00","id":1096695,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the delay in finishing up that character sheet! My week was super busy until today, so planning to finish that up tonight after work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13129-gossamer","name":"Gossamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-25T09:22:17-07:00","id":1096763,"title":"","content":"Hey Gossamer. No worries. I have been busy, myself o.o <br /> <br /> Though, I think we lost a player, so it doesn't seem like we're in a rush or anything. <br /> <br /> We should probably browse about for another player or two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}